abstract: >-
  Think of a shared autonomous vehicle you can genuinely lean back in: you
  alone choose the destination, any detour, and when to stop; the vehicle lifts
  the exhausting work of the route off your hands; your private routes and
  conversations stay strictly yours when you step out, while vehicles warn one
  another anonymously about black ice ahead; personal comfort adapts freely in
  outer layers while the core brakes and safety rules remain unchangeable; and
  in thick fog or unclear roadworks, the system never invents an open road — it
  marks uncertainty openly and slows down honestly, filtering background noise
  at full speed rather than flooding the passenger with alerts.

  ai0S (Adaptive Intelligence Zero System, v3.0) translates those five everyday
  safety laws directly into a verifiable 0/1 architecture for human-AI
  collaboration: (1) external human origin and sovereign veto, (2) strict local
  privacy with anonymized shared warnings, (3) immutable safety core separated
  from layered dynamic knowledge, (4) independent 0/1 verification over fluent
  prose, and (5) full-speed pre-filtering of falsified or autonomy-eroding paths
  without turning human oversight into a bottleneck. Includes bilingual (EN/DE)
  everyday entrance prose, the distilled AI0S.0s core specification, and
  cryptographic origin anchors (Bitcoin OpenTimestamps from block 971315,
  Ed25519 signature 9F4D9A266D720FE6336574D87B410637560297CF). Hands-on
  Apache-2.0 personal AI layer & encrypted vault kit:
  https://github.com/ai0S-laboratories/ai0s-realization-public
